
This directory is intended for project header files.

A header file contains a C declaration of variables, macros, functions, etc,
that can be shared between several project source files. You request the use
of a header file in your project source file (C, C++, etc) located in `src`
folder by using the C preprocessing directive `#include`.

Please read this comprehensive documentation for more details:
https://docs.platformio.org/page/projectconf/section_env_build.html#build-flags

